  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Roughly chop Asian greens. Drain sweetcorn. • Cut Japanese tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d4c4a648afcacfd6a3/step-3bde5700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook corn until slightly charred, 3-4 minutes. • Add the egg and Asian greens and cook, tossing, until wilted and egg is scrambled, 1-2 minutes. • Add microwavable basmati rice, plant-based kimchi, baby spinach leaves, garlic paste, the soy sauce and brown sugar and cook, tossing, until fragrant, 2-3 minutes. • Transfer to serving bowls, season with pepper and cover to keep warm.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d4c4a648afcacfd6a3/step-4e240f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. • When the oil is hot, cook tofu and sweet soy seasoning, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes. • Add sweet chilli sauce, a splash of water and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d4c4a648afcacfd6a3/step-97a3e620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Top kimchi fried rice with tofu to serve. Garnish with sesame seeds. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d4c4a648afcacfd6a3/step-25382530.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
